- **Evidence is A-band apart from that.** 14/14 load-bearing quotes inline, 17 testimony quotes in the body, seven dated transcripts backing the first-person material. Four loosely tagged items outside the scanned slots (the 1-9 one-score record, the draft-advisory-board grade, "Kansas City radio" for the flopping concession, "told reporters" on Aug 8) are listed in the sidecar.
- **What earns the B+:** the draft-night phone call as object-of-fear discriminator ("the thing he was afraid of losing was the coach"), the Kelce trap → confession → borrowed Alex Smith film-week timeline (untransplantable), critic pressure faced and conceded twice, empathy turn in his own vocabulary rather than house armor grammar, zero contrast pairs, zero counter-typing ladders in the body, current-tense anchor dated yesterday.
